{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/atwba5wz","slide":1,"text":"GB10 面对的是 UMA + CUDA + SSD expert store，需要显式处理 SSD→DDR→GPU copy/compute overlap，Metal 方案没有现成答案。","textPreview":"GB10 面对的是 UMA + CUDA + SSD expert store，需要显式处理 SSD→DDR→GPU copy/compute overlap，Metal 方案没有现成答案。","textChars":95,"textLines":1,"bbox":[160,251,564,22]}
